  "instance_name": "zombie_apocalypse_as_inevitable",
  "label": "The idea that a zombie apocalypse is an inevitable or unstoppable event",
  "description": "The idea that a zombie apocalypse is an inevitable or unstoppable event is often used in popular culture to depict a world in chaos. In the meme, this idea is used to imply that racially motivated violence is an inevitable or unstoppable event, thereby justifying or minimizing its impact. This requires understanding of the idea of a zombie apocalypse as inevitable and its implications.",
